{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/4oru95tmr67hh4754dwg5b1kvzwol3t.mp3","text":"喂，博士，有没有什么好玩的事情？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/b7cdumlgp7kv4njjm1d0jo0zskpflun.mp3","text":"啧，得想个办法让食堂的青椒永远消失。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/2sc2cm64od1l5qtmu9xcnsvr4cmdpoo.mp3","text":"炎国有一句谚语，叫——“及时行乐”，嘿，这句话很适合小爷我。未来？这种东西让奥斯塔去想就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/jjuymonnq7nxb92sl3pm7dpfxwejb0t.mp3","text":"喂，博士，别老坐那儿啊，我们来找点乐子吧，比如把这间办公室改造一下怎么样？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/hmm2pj5j32klzwywk6n2xvc40i4e0y4.mp3","text":"奥斯塔以前跟我说，我这样活不久。我当时告诉他，如果我不这样，那活久了又有什么意思？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/0ti0rqtt88qtt660bx4infrp8wqgtv8.mp3","text":"想要的就去争，喜欢的就去抢，小爷我的字典里，从来没有“放弃”两个字！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/q388hwgwjvayxp0txktaz8sw3vavwtt.mp3","text":"我来想做什么，奥斯塔想怎么做，布洛卡就负责一起做，一直以来，我们都是这么过来的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/20tqrplzlhjkmn6m36gkyo6kj89aqr2.mp3","text":"博士，皱着眉头想什么呢，有什么烦恼说给我听听，我来帮你出主意，这个我擅长。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/pl8w5xg4kdv5nhv7g08pzub9m1tqwno.mp3","text":"我说，博士，哪天你要是不当罗德岛的头头了，来跟我们一起干怎么样？小爷我平时不服谁，但对你是服气的，我给你打下手也ok啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/ljjllr4be7t8n7aanw0rjqfz0f8zwpn.mp3","text":"喂，博士......怎么睡着了，算了，那等会儿再说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/i0efe2vv2rsrf2r7ty77bkesp8874cx.mp3","text":"嘿，你就是博士吧？你好你好，幸会幸会，小爷贾维，今天起就是你的手下了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/qdnirm5ttoie3s8quxrsybgup8b8nn8.mp3","text":"啧啧，奥斯塔，快过来瞧瞧，我有一天也要变得这么强！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/o8ifodr6nzk8fuucmp5p37f6r0m8e1z.mp3","text":"啊？升职？那是什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/ax5437td6lwj4m268plylifyssdptqs.mp3","text":"不得了啊，罗德岛里有趣的家伙也太多了，这让我怎么坐得住，要变得更强，更强才行！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/pq3mz8s6toxbcp9g52bs8qb8obr7fdk.mp3","text":"嘿，走着！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/jms700vdje0ju3sb7wunzgj8t5kkxw5.mp3","text":"听我说，各位，我有个计划！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/nmxirp000wjp3ejf1hprgkuldhcrkcw.mp3","text":"哈哈，让我们干一票大的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/19l8eax8km4hb0ipvc3bmlg22797i0v.mp3","text":"把他们全都干趴下就行了吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/46qxqvfu11ji17pa35dg5fhzgmld0qm.mp3","text":"还没轮到小爷？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/32/idh76fk0fkm2itcspx1ah6xhz7f6ny8.mp3","text":"别让我太无聊啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/qczpx7n5dkvjvj6d8cqh0390uceidrs.mp3","text":"我已经等不及了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/q68a7tdvqibtf0rebgbu1yn5lc5odv8.mp3","text":"哈哈，你们死定了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/lkg9t3g5crnf2p1xktf7me1esomo2ex.mp3","text":"尝尝这个！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/cm6wydkermvos9q8gq6t1gb2v9a0605.mp3","text":"喂，别跑啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/mb48fbru5ndbkqne8cpkakega1htsfx.mp3","text":"好了好了，你们已经很努力了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/4ugr01l0ck8s3weu1tfj0fey7tndzv1.mp3","text":"我兴奋起来了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/2eq5hv03xlko6h6gqx0lp1p03txa9ln.mp3","text":"哈，就是要这样的任务才刺激啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/sxpqos3a4fu7vdiuanae8w8563nqp3n.mp3","text":"啧啧，没什么挑战啊，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/kta8kljh4ls6d1fuqm5g8fgjkl0v3l4.mp3","text":"啊？溜了几个？我都没发现。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/njtyah6nmmcbx209rthopbzjwmxzj86.mp3","text":"Che cazzo uomo！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/evjtk5rmvix1hnoot3y0hhngpm25jdu.mp3","text":"大哥大姐们好啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/qm07al7f7ro6ku97mlw6dn7uy8anww0.mp3","text":"干嘛？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/ieq2eoxst5hw6afibf5uvwocp2hib2k.mp3","text":"嘿，博士，心情不错啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/1zzqpr5u6jf70x7rtnmnmchfy99613l.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/0nzqa14hwae289do246ha2jck0qi89a.mp3","text":"博士！我和奥斯塔、布洛卡有一个新年计划，哼哼，告诉你的话，你可就必须加入了。我们打算偷偷把食堂的巧克力酱全部换成叙拉古肉酱，然后——欸，博士，你别走啊！别告诉凯尔希医生啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/44sf9aged5fg0rkadz14nin3n9q1t1n.mp3","text":"博士，吃过没？","alt":"voice_cn/char_349_chiave/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/n2kkk4b3jqn8cujpkl41mktp2mit991.mp3","text":"喂，博士，有没有什么好玩的事情？","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/iigpvlcu8454ki9da8plz3x8viv76ov.mp3","text":"啧，得想个办法让食堂的青椒永远消失。","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/razlwfzfmg1d26ifznw9w5srpqzt3hw.mp3","text":"炎国有一句谚语，叫——“及时行乐”，嘿，这句话很适合小爷我。未来？这种东西让奥斯塔去想就好了。","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/cof9mde9f6q4omrxjtsjebexg5dpt4h.mp3","text":"喂，博士，别老坐那儿啊，我们来找点乐子吧，比如把这间办公室改造一下怎么样？","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/pspngpq49y8ok6xhwu7iirgu8dmsmpm.mp3","text":"奥斯塔以前跟我说，我这样活不久。我当时告诉他，如果我不这样，那活久了又有什么意思？","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/103lug4a63guxqvn2erg24koh1bhs1t.mp3","text":"想要的就去争，喜欢的就去抢，小爷我的字典里，从来没有“放弃”两个字！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/dsk70brat14u01cxwbpn831i9emuhhl.mp3","text":"我来想做什么，奥斯塔想怎么做，布洛卡就负责一起做，一直以来，我们都是这么过来的。","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/k0y1r0enb6jnd0xwlpmtm84rlawkxuc.mp3","text":"博士，皱着眉头想什么呢，有什么烦恼说给我听听，我来帮你出主意，这个我擅长。","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/lip0hb4ric2l4cw41x9fe7b8i5ttice.mp3","text":"我说，博士，哪天你要是不当罗德岛的头头了，来跟我们一起干怎么样？小爷我平时不服谁，但对你是服气的，我给你打下手也ok啊。","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/c5dni0rtlbc454urpezmhqa35xet10u.mp3","text":"喂，博士......怎么睡着了，算了，那等会儿再说。","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/g928wpjnygnxmsqc0yma2c9msld7wtv.mp3","text":"嘿，你就是博士吧？你好你好，幸会幸会，小爷贾维，今天起就是你的手下了！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/9r967vc5bd9lc7kmv89nf3o0uu3yl13.mp3","text":"啧啧，奥斯塔，快过来瞧瞧，我有一天也要变得这么强！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/tlzrdldujdwo7n3ykpaqm68qjvbtgo4.mp3","text":"啊？升职？那是什么？","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/40fkju2zw0zz82xtav6z47o1193falm.mp3","text":"不得了啊，罗德岛里有趣的家伙也太多了，这让我怎么坐得住，要变得更强，更强才行！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/48u7tblzc5ikl1j9hlkhnt1noypa5le.mp3","text":"嘿，走着！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/iwazbrqb6ualn0ji19biahdfjwq5t3w.mp3","text":"听我说，各位，我有个计划！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/t7315z3sprp24py3huiyw0qezsgt45d.mp3","text":"哈哈，让我们干一票大的！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/a0hajxt85m8zcjfr937jh2j2od9svai.mp3","text":"把他们全都干趴下就行了吧？","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/iuy9n9azl5u8l10q7k7stxi9pgjcl5r.mp3","text":"还没轮到小爷？","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/fqmifroklod5ompza8nl2l7q2q33njj.mp3","text":"别让我太无聊啊。","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/d2hqnpnhheem9sz7da4wft83vtv955m.mp3","text":"我已经等不及了！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/815ltewv323keihleebyr5my3h306ey.mp3","text":"哈哈，你们死定了！","alt":"voice/char_349_chiave/cn_024.mp3"}],"